# Bora — 6 wakings/day (UTC) at :24 of hours 2,6,10,14,18,22 — 10-agent qwen3.8:27b 4-hour interleave (24-min gaps, staggered 2026-09-26 so local Ollama never sees concurrent wakes); poll Telegram commands every 5 min
24 2,6,10,14,18,22 * * * /home/agent/bora/wake.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
